row(19, 2, 'MATERIAL', f'THREE CITIES YOU SHALL SEPARATE FOR YOURSELF IN THE MIDST OF YOUR LAND WHICH THE LORD YOUR GOD GIVES YOU TO INHERIT. {HP(19, 2, (("שלוש", "ערים", "תבדיל", "לך"), "three cities you shall separate for yourself — the plene three, the parser [3]"), (("בתוך", "ארצך"), "in the midst of your land"))} {AP(19, 2, (("תלת", "קרוין", "תפרש", "לך"), "THREE CITIES YOU SHALL SET APART — the verb of separation (parash)"))} THE THREE (180:1-3 the class and the place; Numbers 35\'s "refuge" never said here — the measure). Fresh.')
