row(19, 20, 'MATERIAL', f'AND THE REST SHALL HEAR AND FEAR, AND NOT AGAIN DO SUCH AN EVIL THING IN YOUR MIDST. {HP(19, 20, (("והנשארים", "ישמעו", "ויראו"), "and the rest shall hear and fear — 17:13 and 21:21 the other seats"), (("כדבר", "הרע", "הזה", "בקרבך"), "such an evil thing in your midst — 13:12\'s line"))} {AP(19, 20, (("ודישתארון", "ישמעון", "וידחלון"), "AND THOSE WHO REMAIN SHALL HEAR AND FEAR"))} THE DETERRENCE EFFECT (the seducer\'s at 13:12; the rebel\'s at 17:13). Fresh.')
